      "value": "Seems like that this won't be added at any time. It has been years, yet we are here and making functional ray cast listeners and togglers, which is really annoying, while we could simply get a distance checker towards UI elements and whatnot, changing the ray cast behavior for VR laser pointers and PC pointer 2D interaction layer.",
